 VALUES ('b40a6c62-c363-5ec1-9431-8e911392e407', 97, '249f74c7-cc2c-5c23-b6c8-1d896bb97022',
         'Authentication Basics', 'Basics Authentication', 'Authentication',
         'Understand HTTP authentication, cookies, and stateless token-based auth.', 'Understand HTTP authentication, cookies, and stateless token-based auth.',
         'HTTP authentication is built into the protocol. Basic auth sends base64-encoded credentials on every request. Digest auth uses a challenge-response flow. Stateless token-based auth (e.g. JWT) encodes user identity in a signed token that the server verifies. Each approach has trade-offs for security and scalability.', 'HTTP authentication is built into the protocol. Basic auth sends base64-encoded credentials on every request. Digest auth uses a challenge-response flow. Stateless token-based auth (e.g. JWT) encodes user identity in a signed token that the server verifies. Each approach has trade-offs for security and scalability.', 90,
         'Decode a JWT token and identify the header, claims, and signature sections.', 'Decode a JWT token and identify the header, claims, and signature sections.',
         'A script that decodes a JWT and prints its sections.', 'A script that decodes a JWT and prints its sections.',
         ARRAY['Can explain Basic/Digest/JWT auth', 'Can decode a JWT']::text[], ARRAY['Can explain Basic/Digest/JWT auth', 'Can decode a JWT']::text[],
         'Create a JWT with a subject and expiration, then verify it with a secret.', 'Create a JWT with a subject and expiration, then verify it with a secret.',
         ARRAY['91']::text[], 'lesson')
