         'Install PostgreSQL, connect via psql, and run basic commands.', 'Install PostgreSQL, connect via psql, and run basic commands.',
         'PostgreSQL is the recommended database for this curriculum. Install it locally or use a cloud instance. The psql command-line tool runs queries, \l lists databases, \dt lists tables, and \d shows table structure. Learn the prompt format and basic meta-commands.', 'PostgreSQL is the recommended database for this curriculum. Install it locally or use a cloud instance. The psql command-line tool runs queries, \l lists databases, \dt lists tables, and \d shows table structure. Learn the prompt format and basic meta-commands.', 100,
