         'User Table Schema', 'User Table Schema', 'Database Project',
         'Design and create a users table with proper constraints, indexes, and a seed script.', 'Design and create a users table with proper constraints, indexes, and a seed script.',
         'A production-ready users table needs a primary key, unique constraints on email, not-null constraints on required fields, and an index on frequently queried columns. Include a seed SQL script with test data. This table will be the foundation for authentication in later days.', 'A production-ready users table needs a primary key, unique constraints on email, not-null constraints on required fields, and an index on frequently queried columns. Include a seed SQL script with test data. This table will be the foundation for authentication in later days.', 120,
