 VALUES ('00c2c4c7-b8bd-54c8-b08e-db2ad4923f27', 151, '9187c7ab-4977-5950-bdb2-3943f6d1a5c4',
         'React Basics', 'React Basics', 'React',
         'Create a React app with Vite, render JSX, and use state with useState.', 'Create a React app with Vite, render JSX, and use state with useState.',
         'React is a library for building user interfaces with reusable components. JSX combines HTML and JavaScript in the template. Every component is a function that returns JSX. useState adds local state to function components. The component updates re-render when state changes. Start your app with `vite react` or `vite add react`.', 'React is a library for building user interfaces with reusable components. JSX يجمع بين HTML و JavaScript في القالب. every component is a function that returns JSX. useState adds local state to function components. the component updates re-render when state changes. Start your app with `vite react` or `vite add react`.', 90,
         'Create a counter component that increments on a button click.', 'Create a counter component that increments on a button click.',
         'A working counter component with state.', 'A working counter component with state.',
         ARRAY['Component renders without errors', 'useState works correctly']::text[], ARRAY['Component renders without errors', 'useState works correctly']::text[],
         'Add a second state variable (e.g., a name) and render both.', 'Add a second state variable (e.g., a name) and render both.',
         '{}'::text[], 'lesson')
