         'Components accept inputs called props (short for properties). Props are read-only and enable composition. Default props provide fallback values. Children lets you compose components with nested content. Naming components with PascalCase is convention.', 'Components accept inputs called props (short for properties). Props are read-only and enable composition. Default props provide fallback values. Children lets you compose components with nested content. Naming components with PascalCase is convention.', 90,
