         'React Project: Counter App', 'React Project: Counter App', 'React project',
         'Build a fully functional counter app with state, event handlers, and styling.', 'Build a fully functional counter app with state, event handlers, and styling.',
         'Build on the basics from days 151–153 to create a polished counter app. Include increment, decrement, and reset buttons. Store the count in state, handle edge cases (e.g., not going below zero), and apply basic styling with inline styles or CSS classes.', 'Build on the basics من days 151–153 to create a polished counter app. Include increment, decrement, and reset buttons. Store the count in state, handle edge cases (e.g., not going below zero), and apply basic styling with inline styles or CSS classes.', 120,
