 VALUES ('55a4c088-ac2f-5473-b92f-c2dd46f5e2b0', 182, 'b4349f9f-b323-5ca5-bc93-0c4b6c105f8f',
         'File-Based Routing', 'File-Based Routing', 'Next.js',
         'Understand pages, nested routes, and dynamic segments. Use link() and useRouter().', 'Understand pages, nested routes, and dynamic segments. Use link() and useRouter().',
         'File-based routing is the core of Next.js. `pages/about.js` maps to `/about`. `pages/[id].js` maps to `/id` with the dynamic value in `params.id`. Use `<Link>` for client-side navigation and `useRouter()` for programmatic navigation.', 'File-based routing is the core of Next.js. `pages/about.js` maps to `/about`. `pages/[id].js` maps to `/id` with the dynamic value in `params.id`. Use `<Link>` for client-side navigation and `useRouter()` for programmatic navigation.', 90,
         'Create a dynamic route at `pages/posts/[slug].js` and display the slug in the UI.', 'Create a dynamic route at `pages/posts/[slug].js` and display the slug in the UI.',
         'A Next.js app with nested routes and dynamic segments.', 'A Next.js app with nested routes and dynamic segments.',
         ARRAY['Nested routes work', 'Link and useRouter are used']::text[], ARRAY['Nested routes work', 'Link and useRouter are used']::text[],
         'Create a dynamic route `[id]` and fetch data with `getStaticProps`.', 'Create a dynamic route `[id]` and fetch data with `getStaticProps`.',
         ARRAY['181']::text[], 'lesson')
