 VALUES ('3ec2f8e1-1fb9-5e48-bc7b-219591317a79', 211, 'edd646a2-39f1-5b49-a26f-d758625ac36b',
         'TypeScript Fundamentals', 'Fundamentals TypeScript', 'TypeScript',
         'Write type annotations, interfaces, and understand generics.', 'Write type annotations, interfaces, and understand generics.',
         'TypeScript adds static typing to JavaScript. Interfaces describe the shape of objects. Generics enable reusable components that work with multiple types. Type inference reduces boilerplate. Understanding type compatibility is key to building maintainable code.', 'TypeScript يضيف التصنيف الثابت إلى JavaScript. الواجهات تصف شكل الكائنات. التمكن من الجيمريك يمكّن من إنشاء مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام تعمل مع أنواع متعددة. ت inference يقلل من التكرار. فهم التوافق النوعي هو مفتاح بناء البرمجيات.', 90,
         'Refactor a small JS file with type annotations, interfaces, and a generic function.', 'Refactor a small JS file with type annotations, interfaces, and a generic function.',
         'A TypeScript file with annotations, an interface, and a generic function.', 'A TypeScript file with annotations, an interface, and a generic function.',
         ARRAY['Can add type annotations', 'Can create an interface']::text[], ARRAY['Can add type annotations', 'Can create an interface']::text[],
         'Create a generic utility type that extracts the return type of a function.', 'Create a generic utility type that extracts the return type of a function.',
         '{}'::text[], 'lesson')
