 VALUES ('2104e760-7616-59e5-80f8-cf585e92d0d3', 213, 'edd646a2-39f1-5b49-a26f-d758625ac36b',
         'Security Basics: XSS and Injection Prevention', 'Fundamentals Security', 'Security',
         'Understand Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) and how to prevent it, and prevent SQL injection.', 'Understand Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) and how to prevent it, and prevent SQL injection.',
         'XSS occurs when untrusted data is inserted into the DOM without proper escaping. Prevent it by escaping HTML, using textContent instead of innerHTML, and validating user input. SQL injection is prevented by using parameterized queries or prepared statements, never concatenating user input into SQL strings.', 'يحدث XSS عند إدخال بيانات غير موثوقة إلى DOM دون تهريب صحيح. منعه بالهروب من HTML، استخدام textContent بدلاً من innerHTML، والتحقق من المدخلات. يتم منع حقن SQL باستخدام استعلامات جاهزة، never concatenating user input into SQL strings.', 100,
         'Take a vulnerable HTML snippet and rewrite it safely, using textContent and escaped data.', 'Take a vulnerable HTML snippet and rewrite it safely, using textContent and escaped data.',
         'A safe HTML snippet with no XSS vulnerabilities.', 'A safe HTML snippet with no XSS vulnerabilities.',
         ARRAY['Can explain XSS', 'Can escape HTML', 'Can write parameterized SQL']::text[], ARRAY['Can explain XSS', 'Can escape HTML', 'Can write parameterized SQL']::text[],
         'Identify the XSS vulnerability in a given code snippet and fix it.', 'Identify the XSS vulnerability in a given code snippet and fix it.',
         ARRAY['212']::text[], 'practice')
